                </TextStylePaint>
                <TextValueRun styleId="706269:17" text="IDEA: the parchment page. The grey figure shrugs (`church`). A single word card: RIGHTEOUSNESS, and under it, right doing (`right`). A measuring tape unrolls and hangs, asking whose (`whose`). Two small stone tablets set down; the ten lines on them glow gold (`all`). A portrait of God is not drawn: the tablets' glow becomes a face-less warm light (`char`). On `circle` the tablets' outline widens into a gold circle that keeps growing past the page, planets and stars inside it." name="brief" id="706269:20"/>
            </Text>
